  "limitations": "This is a source-instantiated free-tail model: it freely adjoins a finitely supported tail to the already constructed finite localized pair and proves exact quotient cancellation there. It does not independently construct and localize the historical unbounded zeta module or identify that module with the chosen free tail. Every individual Finsupp vector has finite support, and no infinite determinant or infinite product is asserted. The unit coefficient on each tail coordinate belongs to the common-identity-tail model. The module does not prove divisibility ordering, normalization, uniqueness or choice independence of Smith coefficients, identify the finite determinant product with Hentzelt's norm or resultant, or construct later elimination stages."
